The witness guest for E5 (#1233) and grave #1267 (ADR 0121) — provenance, per ADR 0114's rule for committed guest
binaries. Like p3std, it is reproducible from this repository plus the pinned toolchain: p3sleep/build.sh
rebuilds it offline.

Source:       src/main.rs, Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock (this directory). No dependencies and no WIT of its own: its
              imports are the ones Rust std and wasi-libc make for a wasm32-wasip3 program that sleeps. It
              uses the nightly feature thread_sleep_until for std::thread::sleep_until.
